WEBVTT

00:07:59.558 --> 00:08:03.812
And I woke up filled
with longing and sadness

00:08:03.812 --> 00:08:07.525
but also gratitude
for this moment and this dream.

00:08:08.359 --> 00:08:10.569
And I ended up writing a song about it.

00:08:11.237 --> 00:08:13.280
(Guitar plays a soft accompaniment)

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:17.493
(Sings) But it's so good to see you.

00:08:19.161 --> 00:08:23.499
It's so good to see you,

00:08:23.541 --> 00:08:25.960
see you again.

00:08:28.712 --> 00:08:30.005
In the bridge,